@format 1
@id relay.toggle-automatic
@title Toggle automatic relay
@area Relay
@entry input
@summary Enable or disable automatic submission when delivered files arrive in a target tab.
@flow TB
@related relay.select-target, relay.deliver-output

@alias action = Cadroue.UIShell.PMainArea.PAction

[input] Auto-relay checkbox changes <input>
- Receive the requested automatic relay state @ action.PActionAutoApply(...)
> apply

[apply] Apply tab action state <process>
- Update auto-relay state and its visible checkbox @ action.PActionAutoApply(...)
> result

[result] Automatic relay changed <output>
= Delivered files follow the requested automatic-submission behavior.
